{
  "_README": [
    "Opening hours read off each business's OWN website on 8 Aug 2026, keyed by",
    "listing name. Every entry carries the page it came from so it can be",
    "re-checked rather than re-guessed.",
    "",
    "TWO LIMITS TO KNOW ABOUT.",
    "",
    "1. SEASON. Several of these are summer hours with a published end date —",
    "   Quendale Mill closes 11 Oct 2026, Old Haa 4 Oct, Crofthouse 4 Oct,",
    "   Tangwick Haa 30 Sep. The opening_hours column has no notion of a season,",
    "   so these WILL be wrong come the winter. `until` records the date each one",
    "   stops being true; nothing reads it yet.",
    "",
    "2. LUNCH BREAKS. The column holds one range per day, so a place that shuts",
    "   1–2pm can't be expressed. Where that happens the range is the OUTER one",
    "   and `caveat` says so — worth knowing before trusting it for a 1:30 stop."
  ],

